    <node id="NSU">
      <data key="d0">NSU</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Novosibirsk State University (NSU) is a prominent higher education institution dedicated to providing comprehensive academic programs and infrastructure for its student body. As a center for learning and research, the university serves as the primary environment for the employment of diverse teaching staff and the facilitation of scholarly development.

The university is organized into several specialized academic divisions, including the Faculty of Information Technology (FIT), which focuses on computing and digital sciences. Additionally, Novosibirsk State University hosts the Faculty of Economics and the Faculty of Natural Sciences, reflecting its broad commitment to both social and empirical disciplines. Through these various faculties, the institution maintains a robust academic framework designed to support students across a wide range of fields.&lt;SEP&gt;Novosibirsk State University is an educational institution that hosts the Institute of Intelligent Robotics.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b6d2a7fd88178e86b5d144a751ef7e12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a82318078705ea1aaa12f147aec8f4f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ac667fa190f012d8ed66e7ef36a4acd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e45aaf4de9dd2b8f35ec690ffef4ce11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e90ee1508531a0d0286c1af7f4cc4792&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b99eada158dba358ec9c4bccd563a3d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-289f4eb7d30d3af4bc0678a5197d6564&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b0c6015b6de3a66da4ef7370457193b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-005abd6ba3006ed416989746ff36c3ca</data>
      <data key="d4">https://education.nsu.ru/information-technologies/&lt;SEP&gt;https://education.nsu.ru/freshmen&lt;SEP&gt;https://education.nsu.ru/mathematics&lt;SEP&gt;https://education.nsu.ru/physics&lt;SEP&gt;https://education.nsu.ru/promo/geology&lt;SEP&gt;https://education.nsu.ru/economics/&lt;SEP&gt;https://education.nsu.ru/promo/naturalsciences/&lt;SEP&gt;https://education.nsu.ru/mechatronics, https://education.nsu.ru/ai</data>
