    <node id="Novosibirsk State University">
      <data key="d0">Novosibirsk State University</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Novosibirsk State University (NSU) is a prominent higher education institution that integrates a diverse range of academic disciplines, including natural sciences, engineering, and the humanities. The university is structured around several specialized faculties and departments, which facilitate its comprehensive educational mission.

The academic infrastructure of Novosibirsk State University includes the Faculty of Natural Sciences, the Faculty of Physics, and the Faculty of Geology and Geophysics. Furthermore, the institution supports advanced technical and analytical studies through its Mechanics and Mathematics Department, as well as the Faculty of Information Technologies. In addition to these scientific and technical fields, the university maintains a Faculty of Economics, reflecting its commitment to a broad spectrum of scholarly competencies.

Novosibirsk State University offers a variety of bachelor's degree programs designed to prepare students for professional and academic careers. Beyond its core academic offerings, the institution provides a range of student services to support the educational experience of its diverse student body.&lt;SEP&gt;Novosibirsk State University is an educational institution that hosts the Institute of Intelligent Robotics.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9a82318078705ea1aaa12f147aec8f4f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e0187d85fefff382fc2d89e5a6a1039&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edc9c271aedbda6bad0945f4c21a258f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e45aaf4de9dd2b8f35ec690ffef4ce11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e90ee1508531a0d0286c1af7f4cc4792&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b99eada158dba358ec9c4bccd563a3d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-289f4eb7d30d3af4bc0678a5197d6564&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b0c6015b6de3a66da4ef7370457193b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-005abd6ba3006ed416989746ff36c3ca</data>
      <data key="d4">https://education.nsu.ru/information-technologies/&lt;SEP&gt;https://education.nsu.ru/&lt;SEP&gt;https://education.nsu.ru/mathematics&lt;SEP&gt;https://education.nsu.ru/physics&lt;SEP&gt;https://education.nsu.ru/promo/geology&lt;SEP&gt;https://education.nsu.ru/economics/&lt;SEP&gt;https://education.nsu.ru/promo/naturalsciences/&lt;SEP&gt;https://education.nsu.ru/mechatronics, https://education.nsu.ru/ai</data>
      <data key="d5">1773925874</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
